124 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The dataset is balanced, ensuring equal representation of all topic classes, which is essential for a fair evaluation of classification performance. Its concise text format effectively captures the challenges of short-text modeling, such as limited context and high lexical variability. As such, AG News offers a reliable and practical environment for benchmarking tweet topic classification techniques.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [11]
>>
